Cell["\<\
One of the most difficult yet important aspects for our project was choosing \
the correct energy bar placement. We created a function that tests possible \
positions around the agent and chooses the location that is farthest from \
other agents while staying inside the simulation bounds.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.988568726813635*^9, 
  3.988568790996788*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"e7e5605a-9b15-8344-a9b5-\
0946ed64605e"],

